---
import { buildContentData } from "../../data/buildContent";
import HowToBuildCard from "./HowToBuildCard.astro";
---

<section
	id="how-i-build"
	class="w-full bg-secondary px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"
>
	<div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col items-center">
		<!-- Header -->
		<h2
			class="max-w-5xl text-center text-4xl font-bold uppercase leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
		>
			How I build content that

			<span class="relative inline-block font-serif italic text-alert-neutral">
				converts

				<svg
					class="absolute bottom-[-0.28em] left-[-0.03em] h-[0.55em] w-[1.08em] min-w-full overflow-visible"
					viewBox="0 0 260 32"
					fill="none"
					xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
					aria-hidden="true"
				>
					<path
						d="M6 20
            C48 8, 98 8, 148 10
            C125 13, 106 17, 98 22
            C135 14, 190 12, 254 14"
						stroke="currentColor"
						stroke-width="5"
						stroke-linecap="round"
						stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
				</svg>
			</span>
		</h2>

		<!-- Description -->
		<p
			class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-4xl text-center text-base leading-relaxed text-muted sm:text-lg lg:text-xl"
		>
			It's easy to make something look good. It's much harder to make it
			convert. That's why I've spent the last year not just creating “fun”
			videos, but building a strategic UGC approach designed to drive real
			results. Every piece I create follows a framework rooted in human
			psychology and storytelling, so your brand doesn't just get views —
			<span class="font-bold text-tertiary">it gets sales.</span>
		</p>

		<!-- Cards -->
		<div class="mt-12 w-full">
			<HowToBuildCard cards={buildContentData} />
		</div>

		<!-- Bottom Statement -->
		<div
			class="mt-14 flex w-full max-w-4xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-white px-6 py-5 text-center shadow-sm md:flex-row md:text-left"
		>
			<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700 sm:text-base">
				❤️ This isn't random content. It's intentional content that
				<span class="font-medium text-red-400">converts.</span>
			</p>

			<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700 sm:text-base">
				📈 More than views. Real impact.
				<span class="font-medium text-red-400">Real sales.</span>
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
